-- Tests of cp1-months-helpers.l4 (the counting helpers) and cp1-div-b-self-employed-earnings.l4: sections 13, 14, 14.1.
-- Every expected value was worked out by hand from the text before the file was run. Ages go through section 2(2): the
-- age is deemed reached on the first day of the month after the birthday, except in paragraphs 13(1)(c), 13(1)(e) and
-- 13(1.2)(c) where the actual birthday governs. Months are counted from the first of the month.

§ `Tests -- the counting helpers`

#ASSERT `the number of months of a year before a first day` 2024 (YearMonthDay 2024 7 1) EQUALS 6   -- January to June
#ASSERT `the number of months of a year before a first day` 2024 (YearMonthDay 2024 1 1) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the number of months of a year before a first day` 2024 (YearMonthDay 2025 1 1) EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the number of months of a year before a first day` 2024 (YearMonthDay 2023 1 1) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the number of months of a year from a first day` 2024 (YearMonthDay 2024 7 1) EQUALS 6   -- July to December
#ASSERT `the number of months of a year from a first day` 2024 (YearMonthDay 2024 1 1) EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `the number of months of a year from a first day` 2024 (YearMonthDay 2025 1 1) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the number of months of a year from a first day` 2024 (YearMonthDay 2023 12 1) EQUALS 12
`plain person 1980` MEANS `cp1 Facts about a person for a year` WITH
    `the year at hand` IS 2024
    `date of birth of the person` IS (YearMonthDay 1980 6 15)
    `date of death of the person` IS NOTHING
    `date the contributory period of the person ends by reason of disability` IS NOTHING
    `date the disability pension ceases to be payable to the person` IS NOTHING
    `months excluded from the contributory period of the person by reason of disability` IS EMPTY
    `month from which a retirement pension is payable to the person` IS NOTHING
    `date the person makes an election under subparagraph 12(1)(c)(ii)` IS NOTHING
    `date the person revokes the election under subparagraph 12(1)(c)(ii)` IS NOTHING
    `month referred to in the election of the person under paragraph 13(1)(b)` IS NOTHING
    `month referred to in the revocation by the person under paragraph 13(1)(c)` IS NOTHING
`a disability run from March to August 2024` MEANS `cp1 Month period` WITH `first month of the month period` IS (YearMonthDay 2024 3 1), `last month of the month period` IS JUST (YearMonthDay 2024 8 1)
`person with a disability from March to August 2024` MEANS `cp1 Facts about a person for a year` WITH
    `the year at hand` IS 2024
    `date of birth of the person` IS (YearMonthDay 1980 6 15)
    `date of death of the person` IS NOTHING
    `date the contributory period of the person ends by reason of disability` IS NOTHING
    `date the disability pension ceases to be payable to the person` IS NOTHING
    `months excluded from the contributory period of the person by reason of disability` IS LIST `a disability run from March to August 2024`
    `month from which a retirement pension is payable to the person` IS NOTHING
    `date the person makes an election under subparagraph 12(1)(c)(ii)` IS NOTHING
    `date the person revokes the election under subparagraph 12(1)(c)(ii)` IS NOTHING
    `month referred to in the election of the person under paragraph 13(1)(b)` IS NOTHING
    `month referred to in the revocation by the person under paragraph 13(1)(c)` IS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the number of months of the year excluded from the contributory period by reason of disability` `plain person 1980` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the number of months of the year excluded from the contributory period by reason of disability` `person with a disability from March to August 2024` EQUALS 6   -- March to August
